{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484337,"name":"yifan Hong","username":"yifan_Hong","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/b2d939/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T04:25:15.936Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn one long agent conversation only:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI can send messages from the PC chat input.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgent replies do NOT appear in the main conversation pane.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe left sidebar preview DOES show the latest agent reply snippet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMobile shows the full thread.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther agent chats on the same PC work.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport ticket: T-F50170. Still broken after full quit + updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso posted publicly: \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/AloysiusH1113/status/2096449268215128499\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eAloysius on X: \"Grok Bot Windows bug: one long chat — PC can send, but replies don’t show in main pane (sidebar preview updates). Mobile OK; other chats OK. Ticket T-F50170 still open. Any fix? @cursor_ai @xai @grok\" / X\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the affected long agent chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a short message from PC.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutgoing visible; reply missing in main pane; sidebar preview updates.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame chat on mobile shows full thread.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReplies render in the main pane on PC.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop for Windows; still broken after full quit and updates (exact version unknown).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-actual-behavior-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-actual-behavior-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eActual Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMain pane does not render replies for this one chat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works; this Grok Bot PC chat UI is broken for reading replies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-additional-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-additional-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease correlate with T-F50170.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484337-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484337-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T06:46:15.617Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":10,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":50.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170745,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-windows-one-chat-can-send-but-replies-never-render-in-main-pane-sidebar-preview-ok-mobile-ok","display_username":"yifan Hong","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://x.com/AloysiusH1113/status/2096449268215128499","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Aloysius on X: \"Grok Bot Windows bug: one long chat — PC can send, but replies don’t show in main pane (sidebar preview updates). Mobile OK; other chats OK. Ticket T-F50170 still open. Any fix? @cursor_ai @xai @grok\" / X","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136390,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-windows-one-chat-can-send-but-replies-never-render-in-main-pane-sidebar-preview-ok-mobile-ok/170745/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":